Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.62,0:00:32.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格丽泽尔达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Griselda.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.46,0:01:28.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.31,0:01:49.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以睡觉  丽兹  我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can sleep, Lizzie. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.41,0:01:51.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有危险  我可以照顾朱迪思\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's trouble, I can take Judith.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.61,0:01:52.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.52,0:01:55.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真觉得能帮我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think you can help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.59,0:01:56.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我可以  女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I can, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.16,0:02:05.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得那里会有孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think there'll be kids there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.61,0:02:07.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在终点站\N{\fnArial\fs30}At Terminus?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.00,0:02:10.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们的家长保护他们  就会有\N{\fnArial\fs30}If their parents kept them safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.15,0:02:13.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像泰尔西保护了你们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Tyreese kept all of you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.40,0:02:14.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我救了泰尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved Tyreese.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.69,0:02:18.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人对他开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were people shooting at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.46,0:02:20.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我开枪杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shot them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.18,0:02:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先是个男人  然后是个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}First a man, then a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.31,0:02:31.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来不想打中她的头的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean to shoot her in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.80,0:02:34.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.59,0:02:37.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你救了泰尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved Tyreese.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.86,0:02:41.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许那里会有小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe there'll be kids there,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.45,0:02:44.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算他们的家长没能保护他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if their parents couldn't keep them safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.34,0:02:47.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是小孩保护了家长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the kids kept their parents safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.19,0:02:48.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.27,0:02:53.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you have kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.67,0:02:55.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.76,0:02:57.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.31,0:02:59.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}A daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.51,0:03:01.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是什么样子啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was she like?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.87,0:03:05.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她很可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.57,0:03:10.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她天生就心地善良\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't have a mean bone in her body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.35,0:03:14.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以她没活下来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why she isn't here now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.35,0:03:18.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.67,0:03:23.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you miss her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.56,0:03:26.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每天都想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.30,0:03:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会想我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you miss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.53,0:03:36.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没必要想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna have to miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.99,0:03:40.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你累坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead on your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.47,0:03:42.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你妹妹旁边睡吧  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go sleep next to your sister, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.55,0:03:43.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  女士  我可以帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, ma'am, I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.05,0:03:45.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天我需要你帮忙做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need your help looking after things tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.42,0:03:46.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去睡觉  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to sleep, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.73,0:03:57.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.70,0:04:04.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.88,0:04:07.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.15,0:04:12.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.43,0:04:15.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.96,0:04:23.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found some.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.74,0:04:26.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  干得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.40,0:04:43.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-很疼  对吗  -是的  很疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It hurts, right? - Oh, yeah. It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.58,0:04:46.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这会消炎\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will fight the infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.11,0:04:47.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能还会让你退烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might even bring down your fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.14,0:04:53.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.87,0:04:56.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要走三天  还是四天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three days out? Four days?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.07,0:04:59.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在十字路口没看见地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't seen any of those maps at the crossings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.87,0:05:00.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.83,0:05:05.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丽兹心狠手辣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizzie's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:08.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是对人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it comes to people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.67,0:05:11.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.54,0:05:13.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没看到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't seen it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.97,0:05:18.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她把行尸搞混了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How she's confused about them, the walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.13,0:05:21.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她没有看出它们的本质\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't see what they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.31,0:05:23.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉得它们只是不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thinks they're just different.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.35,0:05:33.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米卡也是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mica the same way?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.96,0:05:35.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  她更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she's worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.79,0:05:39.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她太善良了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't have a mean bone in her body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.70,0:05:44.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,, 《汤姆·索耶历险记》的结局好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did "Tom Sawyer" have a happy ending?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.09,0:05:46.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还没有读完呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never got to finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.33,0:05:49.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,汤姆和哈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Tom and Huck,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.35,0:05:52.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阻止了印江·乔埃和他的同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}they stop Injun Joe and his partner
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.61,0:05:54.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后拿到了他们的金子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wind up getting all his gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.66,0:05:57.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-所以说他们最后变富翁了  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So they wind up rich? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.06,0:05:59.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道格拉斯寡妇收养了哈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Widow Douglas adopts Huck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.40,0:06:01.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像你收养了我们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you adopted us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.15,0:06:03.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  就像道格拉斯寡妇一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, just like the Widow Douglas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.40,0:06:05.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我是哈克·费恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm Huck Finn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.64,0:06:08.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你更像汤姆·索耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're more like Tom Sawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.64,0:06:08.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.05,0:06:11.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.70,0:06:13.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你更像哈克·费恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're way more like Huck Finn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.70,0:06:16.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死兔子都没有恶心到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not even grossed out by dead rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.74,0:06:18.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都忘了你以前会给他们读故事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgot you used to read to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.19,0:06:22.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.84,0:07:22.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你闻到了吗  -闻到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You smell that? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.49,0:07:24.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有地方着火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a fire somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.59,0:07:28.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是场大火  这附近没有着火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be a big one. It isn't anywhere around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.11,0:07:33.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该停下来  找点水\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should stop here. We need to look for water.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:35.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去找\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.09,0:07:38.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你需要休息  让胳膊休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you need rest. Rest your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.25,0:07:40.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米卡会帮我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mica will help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.40,0:07:50.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到了树跟草\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spy trees and weeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.97,0:07:53.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.39,0:08:05.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你  待着别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. You stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.37,0:08:53.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyreese.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.16,0:08:58.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时我们必须杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes we have to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.39,0:09:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  但有时我们不必\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that. But sometimes we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.76,0:09:11.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道丽兹比我力气大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know Lizzie can carry a lot more than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.03,0:09:14.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我让你来是因为我有话对你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had you come because I wanted to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.15,0:09:16.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.28,0:09:18.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你很小  而且很善良\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're little and you're sweet
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.03,0:09:20.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这会让你丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and those are two things that can get you killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.97,0:09:22.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能马上长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't change how big you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:24.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望我能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.20,0:09:26.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你可以坚强起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}...but you can toughen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.18,0:09:28.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不必变坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have to be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:31.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以跑  我跑得很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can run. I'm good at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.11,0:09:32.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.14,0:09:38.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我女儿也会跑  但是这不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter ran and it wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.72,0:09:43.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以在监狱里我教孩子们别的技能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I taught the kids at the prison to do more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.51,0:09:45.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以杀行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can kill walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.05,0:09:47.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  我试过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I've tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.04,0:09:52.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟我姐姐不一样  我心理很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not like my sister. I'm not messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.65,0:09:54.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道行尸是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.94,0:09:56.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我不能杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't kill people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.30,0:09:58.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我下不了手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could never do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.44,0:10:02.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些坏人来到监狱的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the bad people were at the prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.22,0:10:04.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就在我们面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were right in front of us
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.74,0:10:07.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我举起枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I held up my gun,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.68,0:10:10.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我没能按下扳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I couldn't pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.42,0:10:13.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀人是不对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing people is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.17,0:10:16.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人杀了凯伦和大卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone killed Karen and David.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.42,0:10:19.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就那样把他们杀了  他们人很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just killed them. They were nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.15,0:10:21.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那有人要杀你怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about people who try to kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.13,0:10:23.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我也不希望杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even wish I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.02,0:10:31.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些人闯进来杀了我们的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}People came in and killed our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.18,0:10:32.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我同情那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I feel sorry for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.88,0:10:35.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.85,0:10:39.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们以前八成不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they probably weren't like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.55,0:10:42.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你迟早得这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sooner or later you're gonna have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.72,0:10:44.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须这么做  不然你就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to do it or you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.05,0:10:47.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你得改变你的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're gonna change the way you think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.53,0:10:49.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须改变  每个人都变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to change. Everyone does now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.62,0:10:51.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情不会自己变好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things don't just work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:52.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.18,0:11:05.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妈曾说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom used to say
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.42,0:11:08.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切自有天意\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything works out the way it's supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.81,0:11:26.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.72,0:11:30.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-山核桃  -我超喜欢山核桃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pecans. - Oh, I love pecans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.10,0:11:32.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们能在这儿喘口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, maybe we could catch our breath here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.66,0:11:39.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是要去终点站的  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still going to Terminus, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.99,0:11:42.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只在这儿待个一两天\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just stay a day or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.29,0:11:43.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这儿有满满一井水\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a well full of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.42,0:11:47.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有围栏  虽然不是很高  但也能挡一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fences. They're not big, but they're something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.72,0:11:49.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我们之前看到鹿了  它们吃山核桃\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we saw deer. They eat pecans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.32,0:11:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该能打到一只来吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be able to kill one to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.80,0:11:52.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也能吃山核桃吧  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can eat these, too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.44,0:11:54.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以吃个饱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can eat your fill and then some.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.24,0:11:55.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.60,0:12:00.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那肯定就是我们刚刚闻到的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet that's what we were smelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.75,0:12:03.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来够远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks far enough away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.77,0:12:05.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道是怎么烧起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder how it started.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.18,0:12:08.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是闪电  也许是营火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe lightning. Maybe a campfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.47,0:12:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以去把围栏补一补\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can patch that fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.90,0:12:11.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里八成是鹿进出的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's probably where the deer are coming from.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.10,0:12:15.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该把开口留着  给自己留条后路\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should leave it. Just play it really safe in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.38,0:12:22.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如里面有个行尸  它还真没怎么动啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's one in there, it's not moving much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.88,0:12:24.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们挨得近一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just stay close,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.89,0:12:26.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一间间慢慢检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}go slow room to room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.38,0:12:28.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姑娘们  你们好好待着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girls, you sit tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.80,0:12:30.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我们出来前你们别进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't come in until we come out
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.69,0:12:32.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论你们听到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter what you hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.14,0:12:33.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好的  -好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.54,0:12:35.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丽兹抱着朱迪思呢  米卡把你的枪拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizzie's got Judith. Mica, get out your gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.23,0:12:37.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得站岗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need to stand watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.03,0:12:41.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坚强点  小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand strong, little lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.08,0:12:54.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.04,0:12:57.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是在想那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.57,0:13:04.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为那里埋了个婴儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it that there was a baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.38,0:13:06.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.73,0:13:11.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会在里面发现一个行尸  然后...\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna find one in there and they're going--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.24,0:13:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说了  它们已经不是人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it. They aren't people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.38,0:13:16.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你错了  所有人都错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're wrong. All of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.46,0:13:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们不是人  丽兹  它们是死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They aren't people, Lizzie. They're just dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.99,0:13:34.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手  住手  住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.41,0:13:41.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.06,0:13:44.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事了  来吧  起来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:48.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  来吧  我抱住你了  小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on. I got you, little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.15,0:13:49.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好了  来吧  -米卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. Come here. - Mica.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.91,0:13:51.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米卡  把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mica, lower the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.39,0:13:54.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做到了  你救了她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it. You saved them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.01,0:13:59.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么这么难过  丽兹  你被吓到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you upset, Lizzie? Were you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.29,0:14:01.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.53,0:14:03.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你为什么哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.46,0:14:06.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.76,0:14:39.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丽兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.58,0:14:42.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起我吼你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I yelled at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.34,0:14:46.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看看这些花儿就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just look at the flowers like you're supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.25,0:14:48.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,数一二三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Count one, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.49,0:14:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  我们一起数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's count together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.00,0:14:51.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧那朵粉色的  你看到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the pink ones over there. You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.17,0:14:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一二三\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.70,0:16:29.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是很心烦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.75,0:16:33.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时我真的不理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I don't understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.41,0:16:35.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我在努力去理解  女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm trying to, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.78,0:16:37.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.78,0:16:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我找到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.24,0:16:44.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我打算给她起名为格丽泽尔达·冈德森\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna name her Griselda Gunderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.86,0:16:49.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有很多水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we got plenty of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.50,0:16:53.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在只要再杀一头鹿就万事齐全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now all we got to do is bag one of them deer and we're all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.62,0:16:55.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那就去弄一头  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then we'll get one. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.10,0:17:04.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么了  -我不太习惯这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's wrong? - I'm not used to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.12,0:17:05.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,习惯什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.66,0:17:09.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们居然在一所房子的客厅里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in a living room in a house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.13,0:17:13.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  所以放松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.27,0:17:41.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该住在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.62,0:18:14.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格丽泽尔达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Griselda.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.23,0:18:18.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丽兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.90,0:18:19.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.74,0:18:24.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快离开它  -不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You get away from it! - No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.67,0:18:25.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-马上  丽兹  -不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right now, Lizzie. - No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.93,0:18:28.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不  不  -丽兹  丽兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no, no. - Lizzie! Lizzie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.88,0:18:31.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.06,0:18:36.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在跟我玩  她只是想要个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was playing with me. She wanted a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.57,0:18:37.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它是想杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wanted to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.75,0:18:40.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我打算引她离开  -你差点就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was gonna lead her away. - You could have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.71,0:18:42.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一回事  你杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the same thing! You killed her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.80,0:18:45.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你杀了她  就是一回事  -丽兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You killed her! It's the same thing! - Lizzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.39,0:18:48.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-如果我杀了你怎么样  -丽兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What if I killed you?! What if I killed you?! - Lizzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.24,0:18:52.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你不明白  你不明白  -丽兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't understand. You don't understand. - Lizzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.56,0:18:55.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不明白  你不懂你不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand. You don't understand. You don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.84,0:18:57.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丽兹  丽兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizzie. Lizzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.42,0:19:00.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不一定要杀她啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.38,0:19:02.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没必要啊  她没想伤害谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't have to. She didn't want to hurt any...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.56,0:19:08.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她没想伤害任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't want to hurt anybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.14,0:19:09.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是我朋友  你却杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was my friend and you killed her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.47,0:19:12.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.90,0:19:14.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.72,0:19:18.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是我朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.65,0:19:58.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会太重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it too heavy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.22,0:20:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会  没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.26,0:20:06.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,火还在烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fire's still burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.07,0:20:09.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也可能熄灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could have gone out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.17,0:20:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  烟还是黑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. The smoke's black.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.74,0:20:14.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果烟是白的  火就熄灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it was white, the fire wouldn't be burning anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.07,0:20:17.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好怀念科学课啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss science class.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.61,0:20:20.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了有时候我们得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for when we had to do stuff like
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.72,0:20:22.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把涡虫切碎什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}cut up planaria worms.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.90,0:20:26.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在得做更残忍的事情  米卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to do worse than that nowadays, Mica.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.11,0:20:29.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不一定吧  -一定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't gotta. - You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.77,0:20:32.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丽兹比你大  她在某种程度上比你强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizzie's bigger than you and in some ways she's stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.39,0:20:34.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你更聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're smarter
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.80,0:20:37.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且你也明白这些...道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you understand these... things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.17,0:20:40.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得照顾她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to look out for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.97,0:20:41.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.16,0:20:48.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  来吧  你来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, go ahead. You do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.22,0:20:51.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像我在监狱里教你的一样  开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like I showed you at the prison. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.42,0:21:16.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.70,0:21:24.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还有核桃啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have peaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.12,0:22:16.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们不必去终点站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we don't need to go to Terminus.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.95,0:22:19.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.46,0:22:22.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米卡说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mica's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.86,0:22:25.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.17,0:22:27.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.12,0:22:32.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我了解丽兹和米卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know Lizzie and Mica.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.59,0:22:35.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我了解朱迪斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know Judith.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.32,0:22:38.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.58,0:22:40.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.64,0:22:43.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除你们之外  我不知道还能信任谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't know if I can get that anywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.31,0:22:47.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.02,0:22:49.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.88,0:22:59.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丽兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizzie?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.59,0:23:03.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丽兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizzie?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.16,0:23:24.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.91,0:23:27.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还会来喂你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.48,0:23:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丽兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.54,0:23:33.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们给它们取名字时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we were giving them names,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.95,0:23:36.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是在假装这一切很好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were just pretending things weren't bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.15,0:23:37.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实一点不好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things are bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.94,0:23:40.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些行尸  它们很坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those things, they're bad. They are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.22,0:23:42.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再自欺欺人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't pretend anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.03,0:23:46.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有骗自己  是你在骗自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not pretending. You were.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.66,0:23:50.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我听得见他们的心声\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I can hear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.98,0:23:56.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们想杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.45,0:24:00.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们只不过是想改变我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just want me to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.90,0:24:02.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我变得跟他们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can make me be like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.62,0:24:05.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许我应该改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I should change.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.65,0:24:08.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.05,0:24:11.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样你们就明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can make you all understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.16,0:24:11.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丽兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizzie. 
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.65,0:24:19.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丽兹  它们来了  丽兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizzie, they're coming. Lizzie!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.31,0:24:29.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.84,0:24:41.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.78,0:24:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救我  卡萝儿  丽兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help, Carol! Lizzie!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.92,0:24:47.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-丽兹  -米卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lizzie! - Mica!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.83,0:24:48.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-米卡  -丽兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mica! - Lizzie!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.78,0:24:50.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我  救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go! Help me! 
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.06,0:24:54.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-救命  -躲到我们身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help! - Get behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.10,0:25:30.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.85,0:25:34.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.72,0:25:57.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得帮忙阻止它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to help stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.99,0:26:02.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在知道它们是什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand what they are now?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.93,0:26:06.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know--
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.78,0:26:10.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我必须做什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I have to do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.77,0:26:12.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.02,0:26:17.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实很丑恶  很可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ugly and it's scary
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.09,0:26:18.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也的确会改变你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it does change you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.98,0:26:24.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一路走来  我们都变了很多 \N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how we get to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.21,0:26:27.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是成长的代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the cost. That's growing up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.35,0:26:30.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想伤害任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to hurt anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.01,0:26:34.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想当坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to be mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.75,0:26:36.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候你必须狠心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to be sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.31,0:26:39.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过也只是有时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}But just sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.61,0:26:45.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.93,0:26:51.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有很多山核桃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we have a lot of pecans here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.53,0:26:53.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一大堆\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.41,0:26:55.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-吃烦了吗  -没\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You getting sick of them yet? - Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.74,0:27:02.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我小时候  常和祖母一起做这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to make these with my grandma when I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.25,0:27:04.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闻起来真香\N{\fnArial\fs30}They smell good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.82,0:27:08.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样  好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.67,0:27:09.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你们可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you guys are ready
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.62,0:27:11.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始做点饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to start doing the cooking around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.21,0:27:13.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁想把它们放进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wants to put 'em in?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.19,0:27:14.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.97,0:27:21.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姑娘们喜欢这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girls like it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.72,0:27:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以修缮一下  种些吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could build it up, plant more food.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.70,0:27:27.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还可以找辆车  以备逃生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could find a car for an escape route just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.10,0:27:35.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不想去终点站  我们可以留在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't want to go to Terminus, we could stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.74,0:27:40.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.03,0:27:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不是说我们永远都不去那了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't mean we can't go someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.13,0:27:51.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.29,0:27:56.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我们离终点站越来越近  我意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we were getting closer and closer, i realized
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.67,0:28:01.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还没有做好和其他人一起生活的准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just not ready to be around other people yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.13,0:28:03.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.82,0:28:14.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我梦到了凯伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dream about Karen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.13,0:28:19.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我每天晚上都会梦到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see her every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.70,0:28:24.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次我都会忘记她已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And every time I forget she's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.92,0:28:31.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.76,0:28:34.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会说说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}we just talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.35,0:28:39.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sometimes
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.09,0:28:42.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看见她在人群中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see her in the crowd...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.69,0:28:47.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在一个我从没去过的城市里\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a city I've never been to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.56,0:28:51.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是在一切都还没有发生的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's back before everything happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.40,0:28:59.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而有的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.48,0:29:04.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些晚上  我会做恶梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}some nights, the bad ones...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.83,0:29:08.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梦到有人杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see someone kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.88,0:29:16.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,某个陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.93,0:29:23.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我就又一次失去了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I lose her all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.03,0:29:33.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但就是这样  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's the deal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.01,0:29:36.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活下来的人被死去的人所纠缠\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people who are living are haunted by the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.03,0:29:40.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就是这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.79,0:29:43.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们做我们该做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we do what we do
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.26,0:29:45.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们还在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause they're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.74,0:29:48.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我们的脑海中\N{\fnArial\fs30}In our heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.61,0:29:51.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在树林里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.58,0:29:55.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整个世界都是他们的影子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole world is haunted now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.10,0:29:59.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们无处可逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's no getting out of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.66,0:30:03.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到死为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not until we're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.48,0:30:07.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyreese.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.14,0:30:24.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他们不是在纠缠我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they're not haunting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.48,0:30:31.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他们只是在教导我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they're just teaching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.82,0:30:35.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,提醒着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helping remind us so--
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.58,0:30:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样我们才能接受必须做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that we can live with what we have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.82,0:30:56.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远不要为自己感到羞耻  卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you ever be ashamed of who you are, Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.67,0:31:00.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为这些姑娘做了正确的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did right by those girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.15,0:31:03.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为大家做了正确的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did right by everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.34,0:31:20.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会抓到一只的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get one yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.75,0:31:23.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许还没到打鹿的季节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably not even deer season.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.95,0:31:28.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我丈夫以前经常打猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband used to hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.62,0:31:33.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每年都会讲同一个蠢笑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd tell the same stupid joke every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.12,0:31:36.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说来听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna tell it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.93,0:31:39.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话不能说半句  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess I have to now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.07,0:31:39.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.05,0:31:41.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.34,0:31:46.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坚果罐头和鹿睾丸有什么区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the difference between beer nuts and deer nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.45,0:31:51.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坚果罐头大约1.79美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beer nuts are around 1.79,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.98,0:31:55.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而鹿的睾丸不到1美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}deer nuts are just under a buck.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.98,0:31:55.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.23,0:31:57.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的是好蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good stupid,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.46,0:32:00.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但绝对不是个好笑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}but in no way is it stupid good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.50,0:32:03.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了嘛  还有好多这种笑话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I told you. There's more where that came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.13,0:32:18.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心  她会醒过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. She'll come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.99,0:32:20.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有伤到她的脑子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't hurt her brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.72,0:32:47.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我们得等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no! We have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.50,0:32:48.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要展示给你看  你会明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to show you. You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.62,0:32:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会明白的  我们得等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll finally get it. We have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.34,0:32:56.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丽兹  放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizzie, put the gun down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.83,0:32:58.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想让大家等一等\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want us to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.59,0:33:00.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能等\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.47,0:33:04.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能等  你把枪给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can wait. You just give me the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.50,0:33:06.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能等  我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can wait, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.55,0:33:20.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和泰尔西应该把朱迪斯带进屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Tyreese should take Judith back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.41,0:33:22.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里对她不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not safe for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.66,0:33:25.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但朱迪斯也会变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Judith can change, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.09,0:33:28.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我正打算...  -她还不会走路呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was just about to-- - She can't even walk yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.66,0:33:33.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.40,0:33:38.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩把朱迪斯带回屋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you two take Judith back to the house
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.74,0:33:41.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们吃午饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll have lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.96,0:33:44.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会绑住米卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll just tie Mica up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.15,0:33:46.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确保她不会乱跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, just so she won't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.96,0:33:49.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你保证你会那样做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise that's what you'll do?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.32,0:33:53.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.88,0:33:56.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会用她的鞋带绑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll use her shoelaces.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.71,0:34:19.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们走  丽兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's-- let's go, Lizzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.50,0:35:04.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给她带了些食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought her some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.30,0:35:07.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,检查了她的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cleared out her room.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.81,0:35:10.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确保她没有刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made sure she doesn't have any knives,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.34,0:35:13.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或任何武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.54,0:35:23.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她有一个装满老鼠的鞋盒\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has a shoe box full of mice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.05,0:35:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我问她  是不是她在监狱给行尸喂食\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked her if she was the one feeding the walkers at the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.27,0:35:32.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.34,0:35:38.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有在墓地\N{\fnArial\fs30}And at the tombs,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.31,0:35:42.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们找到的那只兔子\N{\fnArial\fs30}we found this rabbit
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.48,0:35:45.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被扯得四分五裂  钉在木板上\N{\fnArial\fs30}pulled apart and nailed to a board.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.84,0:35:49.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是她干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.16,0:35:53.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说只是为了取乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said she was just having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.37,0:36:01.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.87,0:36:04.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是她杀死了凯伦和大卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe she killed Karen and David.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.62,0:36:08.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不知道她怎么能把他们拖走\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't know how she could drag them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.57,0:36:11.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会让他们变行尸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She would have let them turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.25,0:36:14.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是她杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.89,0:36:22.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.36,0:36:25.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以跟她离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could leave with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.42,0:36:27.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.47,0:36:32.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能跟她和朱迪斯睡在同一屋檐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't sleep with her and Judith under the same roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.56,0:36:36.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你撑不下去的  靠自己不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't make it. Not on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.06,0:36:37.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不能跟着其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't be around other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.54,0:36:41.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们可以试着帮她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we could try to help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.52,0:36:44.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让她想明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk her back somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.12,0:36:46.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她就是这样的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.45,0:36:50.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经定型了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was already there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.75,0:36:55.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没料到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.60,0:36:57.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你怎么可能料到  -我该料到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How could you? - I should have seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.54,0:37:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.99,0:37:07.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和朱迪斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Judith.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.78,0:37:09.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也撑不下去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't make it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.46,0:37:17.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能让她跟着其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't be around other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.16,0:37:44.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该摘些野花\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should pick some wildflowers for Mica
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.35,0:37:47.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等米卡醒来后送给她\N{\fnArial\fs30}to give her when she comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.68,0:37:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  她会喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she'd love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.93,0:37:58.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,火还在烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fire's still burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.37,0:38:01.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.90,0:38:04.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烟是白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The smoke's white.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.33,0:38:05.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.52,0:38:09.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么都知道  女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know everything, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.28,0:38:11.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.17,0:38:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.87,0:38:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.53,0:38:24.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你生我的气吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you mad at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.14,0:38:27.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是想跟我说这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you wanted to talk to me about?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.24,0:38:32.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉我用枪指着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I pointed my gun at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.64,0:38:35.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想让你等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just needed you to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.63,0:38:39.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.95,0:38:43.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.55,0:38:46.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你生我气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're mad at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.46,0:38:51.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你  丽兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Lizzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.76,0:38:58.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切自有天意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everything works out the way it's supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.66,0:39:01.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.52,0:39:05.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你别生我的气  我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't be mad at me. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.53,0:39:09.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着花吧  丽兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just-- just look at the flowers, Lizzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.78,0:39:17.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just look at the flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.42,0:39:28.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着花就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just-- just look at the flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.42,0:39:28.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.84,0:41:31.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我杀了凯伦和大卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed Karen and David.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.84,0:41:39.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须阻止疫病扩散\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to stop the illness from breaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.39,0:41:41.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须救其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to stop other people from dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.82,0:41:49.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是丽兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't Lizzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.23,0:41:53.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't a stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.85,0:41:59.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰尔西  是我干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyreese, it was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.30,0:42:10.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要动手就动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do what you have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.78,0:42:28.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀她时她知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she know what was happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.17,0:42:33.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她害怕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was she scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.52,0:42:45.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下手利落吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was quick?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.63,0:42:49.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.16,0:43:09.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你随便处置我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what you have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.39,0:43:32.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我原谅你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.66,0:43:38.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我永远不会忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm never gonna forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.81,0:43:42.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.38,0:43:44.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你下的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.09,0:43:47.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能感受到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.60,0:43:49.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.67,0:43:53.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这变成了你的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a part of you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.89,0:43:57.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是我的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.65,0:44:05.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我原谅你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.26,0:44:13.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.05,0:44:21.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不必留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.22,0:44:27.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.30,0:44:56.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不怕杀行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not afraid to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.01,0:45:00.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是内心害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.42,0:45:04.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.93,0:45:06.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如何做到呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.70,0:45:07.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去攻克它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.45,0:45:10.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战胜它\N{\fnArial\fs30}and fight it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.30,0:45:13.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.56,0:45:17.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后某天\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.24,0:45:21.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you just change.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.67,0:45:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都会变\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all change.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.91,0:45:31.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
